                      Installation of Tecoris

Place the file Tecoris.app in \app\ directory 
  and the file Tecoris.pic in \app\jof\ on the same disk

Use the "Install" option of the "app" menu, choose tecoris and press ENTER

A file "Tecoris.dat" will automatically be created in \app\jof\ directory.
You can delete it whenever you want: it is just needed to remember you the 
last password you have used and the keycode to register.

So this programm is not freeware, you can play freely the first 5 levels, but 
next some messages appear on the screen, preventing you of playing. They
appear more and more frequently. The only way to disable them is to register.
Registering will free your guilty conscience and help the author to create 
always more programms.
